<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-050" chapter-id="c-songshu-050-hudanmao" source-id="s-songshu-050-hudanmao-ws2371899">
  <p id="c-songshu-050-hudanmao:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">二十四年，<persName id="c-songshu-050-hudanmao:p001:m0005" ref="otw_1ui_wba">藩</persName>第十六子<persName id="c-songshu-050-hudanmao:p001:m0010" ref="otw_1ui_wba_C">誕世</persName>、第十七子<persName id="c-songshu-050-hudanmao:p001:m0017" ref="otw_1ui_wba_D">茂世</persName>率羣從二百餘人攻破郡縣，殺太守<persName id="c-songshu-050-hudanmao:p001:m0034" ref="a50_9n2_6q4">桓隆之</persName>、令<persName id="c-songshu-050-hudanmao:p001:m0039" ref="zti_b7j_qaq">諸葛和之</persName>，欲奉庶人<persName id="c-songshu-050-hudanmao:p001:m0048" ref="e9f_a95_f00">義康</persName>。值交州刺史<persName id="c-songshu-050-hudanmao:p001:m0056" ref="v9j_1fp_kma_A">檀和之</persName>至豫章，討平之。</p>
</text>
